ge":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Eri's decided to start using Appter. But it starts producing tweets without her knowledge... Meanwhile, a powerful Leviathan assassin attacks the team! Who will appear to save them in their most dangerous hour?!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-04-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2Dj1Qkeby4vLNISG5ZWHvcofE1f.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2Dj1Qkeby4vLNISG5ZWHvcofE1f.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68099/season/1/episode/27"},{"id":"1303689","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":28,"title":{"value":"Episodio 28","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The battle with Sateramon is going south fast! But the one who comes to save them is Yujin, who's partnered with Offmon and uses the powerful App Drive Duo!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-04-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8ZBHOZmvQ2vXPGnfuUfdeTe7bcN.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8ZBHOZmvQ2vXPGnfuUfdeTe7bcN.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68099/season/1/episode/28"},{"id":"1310266","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":29,"title":{"value":"Episodio 29","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Everyone's crazy about Offmon! Gatchmon is sulking about it, and decides to flee the secret base in Apprealized form! Dokamon and Musimon decide to run away with him too.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-04-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2qJRvXTtwP01gj3GuetDCWBUlRz.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2qJRvXTtwP01gj3GuetDCWBUlRz.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68099/season/1/episode/29"},{"id":"1310267","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":30,"title":{"value":"Episodio 30","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Eri's become a true master food reviewer! The female Perorimon, Maripero, comes to Eri to learn her secrets! But why does Dokamon have to look after her, then?!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-04-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1EPreqMwQ6BvLjIWITEpCN2j2d1.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1EPreqMwQ6BvLjIWITEpCN2j2d1.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68099/season/1/episode/30"},{"id":"1313884","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":31,"title":{"value":"Episodio 31","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The App Driver team heads to a hot springs, but their travel app takes them to a creepy traditional inn instead! The scenery is scary and they get soaked to the bone... Something's got to be wrong here!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-05-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nKI5yq7DqtJ51cj7eXHO6cCu4OR.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nKI5yq7DqtJ51cj7eXHO6cCu4OR.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68099/season/1/episode/31"},{"id":"1316958","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":32,"title":{"value":"Episodio 32","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Traumatized after injuring Yujin's, Offmon shuts himself away from the team. Haru and the others try to devise different strategies to get him to come back out.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-05-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fH9TfqlBAK1pCoykEYsyd5DoFlc.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fH9TfqlBAK1pCoykEYsyd5DoFlc.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68099/season/1/episode/32"},{"id":"1320191","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":33,"title":{"value":"Episodio 33","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"To find his little brother Hajime, Rei and Hackmon dive back into the deep web. While searching for clues, they infiltrate the important individuals data center to steal top-secret information,.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-05-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gXo9MCCwAAbnXSqx60iD9BqbWk6.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gXo9MCCwAAbnXSqx60iD9BqbWk6.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68099/season/1/episode/33"},{"id":"1325345","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":34,"title":{"value":"Episodio 34","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Massive corporation L-Corp doesn't just create smartphone OSes and home electronics, they also sponsor Appliyama 470... and they've created a city run by artificial intelligence, which the whole gang gets to go see!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-05-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5ud5Ve7HEy3YpJEhCQ9q1czL1iV.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5ud5Ve7HEy3YpJEhCQ9q1czL1iV.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68099/season/1/episode/34"},{"id":"1325346","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":35,"title":{"value":"Episodio 35","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"It's time for Appliyama 470's biggest event, the ranking vote! Eri's working her hardest to take the number one spot, but when the preliminary results come out, she gets the surprise of a lifetime!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-06-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9R36eLvnp2M59RTpno2SuKHDlrE.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9R36eLvnp2M59RTpno2SuKHDlrE.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68099/season/1/episode/35"},{"id":"1327251","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":36,"title":{"value":"Episodio 36","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"At last, the Appliyama 470 election results are revealed! Who will take #1? Who will be the new Nine Goddesses? Could Eri be one of them?! Meanwhile, Rei and Hackmon infiltrate L-Corp to investigate some mysterious video data!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-06-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qPlrcN1vRNeXVLe4wi62kr8Gqu7.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qPlrcN1vRNeXVLe4wi62kr8Gqu7.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68099/season/1/episode/36"},{"id":"1330319","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":37,"title":{"value":"Episodio 37","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Haru and the others have saved Eri, but they're confronted by the Ultimate Four Appmon! The team Ultimate Apprealize all their Appmon to face them.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-06-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/emtF9r4yfSdkzkb7HLDipFDfpt.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/emtF9r4yfSdkzkb7HLDipFDfpt.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68099/season/1/episode/37"},{"id":"1331730","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":38,"title":{"value":"Episodio 38","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Yujin is captured by the Ultimate Four, and the App Drives are destroyed, meaning Gatchmon and the others are all gone! Haru is feeling adrift, when suddenly, he hears a voice from an unexpected place.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-06-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pmCPLgCpmTJmoRUl6aA57jRAMV8.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pmCPLgCpmTJmoRUl6aA57jRAMV8.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68099/season/1/episode/38"},{"id":"1337763","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":39,"title":{"value":"Episodio 39","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"With the help of Deneimon, Haru and the others acquire App Drive Duos, and head to the Appmon Graveyard to save Yujin! What is the secret power hidden inside their new Drives?!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-07-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rIEBfzPf7EgMYSWucnUNHstiqAJ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rIEBfzPf7EgMYSWucnUNHstiqAJ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68099/season/1/episode/39"},{"id":"1337764","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":40,"title":{"value":"Episodio 40","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The rest of the team leave Rei and Hackmon to face Biomon as they race forward, but Eri and Dokamon are confronted by Beautymon, and Torajiro and Musimon are stopped by Fakemon!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-07-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hmYapoICLrn0c3V7XfFJ1GSuVRy.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hmYapoICLrn0c3V7XfFJ1GSuVRy.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68099/season/1/episode/40"},{"id":"1372529","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":41,"title":{"value":"Episodio 41","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Haru arrives at Charisma Castle, where Yujin is being held by Leviathan. There, he faces off with the strongest of the Ultimate Four, Charismon, and learns the true identity of the sinister Cloud!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-07-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/riVPKhg2YYX0OEbqiAGmwxaACwe.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/riVPKhg2YYX0OEbqiAGmwxaACwe.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68099/season/1/episode/41"},{"id":"1395321","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":42,"title":{"value":"Episodio 42","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Rei has found a clue about Hajime's whereabouts. Though Eri is thinking of quitting Appliyama because of L-Corp's new CEO, he gets her to agree to let him disguise as her manager to infiltrate the company. But what is his plan?!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-07-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/r9vNycXe5k3tCBKe4csD2QmcndC.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r9vNycXe5k3tCBKe4csD2QmcndC.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68099/season/1/episode/42"},{"id":"1395327","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":43,"title":{"value":"Episodio 43","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Let's see who can get Sleepmon to wake up first! The Appmon try all different kinds of tactics, but Sleepmon shows no sign of waking.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-07-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fWL4uQJpGhqoXwBPiYwlZ6eS2b.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fWL4uQJpGhqoXwBPiYwlZ6eS2b.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68099/season/1/episode/43"},{"id":"1395328","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":44,"title":{"value":"Episodio 44","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Hajime, finally himself again, learns of Operation: Human Applications, a plan to turn all of humanity into easily-regulated data. And the key to stopping Leviathan's terrible plan is... Bootmon?!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-08-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jH0LKdhrmYy5sJglQN5hNSDkf7u.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jH0LKdhrmYy5sJglQN5hNSDkf7u.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68099/season/1/episode/44"},{"id":"1395329","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":45,"title":{"value":"Episodio 45","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Video game characters are causing chaos in IOT devices everywhere! Haru finds that a common link behind the rampages is a character from a monster-raising RPG he played as a child.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-08-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jt1zV0ZBFlVF2p7XfxckmMMgtx1.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jt1zV0ZBFlVF2p7XfxckmMMgtx1.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68099/season/1/episode/45"},{"id":"1395330","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":46,"title":{"value":"Episodio 46","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Astora is determined to stream a meteor shower live for a special fan in the hospital, but he's ambushed and sent to live at an inescapable temple complex. Time for the team to run a jailbreak!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-08-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/q9p9dFkgjtuAQOsw1R5PNjm9LZj.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/q9p9dFkgjtuAQOsw1R5PNjm9LZj.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68099/season/1/episode/46"},{"id":"1395331","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":47,"title":{"value":"Episodio 47","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Bootmon keeps running away with his emergency evacuation program! The team completes a special program which lets Haru finally make contact... but just then, Yujin starts acting strangely...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-08-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7wxPA0Xa6yv5Fz3SOjFPanxHrZ1.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7wxPA0Xa6yv5Fz3SOjFPanxHrZ1.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68099/season/1/episode/47"},{"id":"1395332","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":48,"title":{"value":"Episodio 48","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Just as things seemed to be working out, Yujin revealed his terrible secret! Bootmon is evolved into a more advanced form, and the God-grades are released.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-09-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/67uBvQXlAkcWGJiMnasP7HsEGD1.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/67uBvQXlAkcWGJiMnasP7HsEGD1.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68099/season/1/episode/48"},{"id":"1395333","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":49,"title":{"value":"Episodio 49","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Leviathan initiates Operation: Human Applications, and little by little, the people of the world are converted into apps. Eri, Astora, and Rei apprealize their God Appmon to try to defeat Deusmon!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-09-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wpsmPEPdThjapSLDZ1sloxzTuDu.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wpsmPEPdThjapSLDZ1sloxzTuDu.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68099/season/1/episode/49"},{"id":"1395334","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":50,"title":{"value":"Episodio 50","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"A massive shadow appears in the skies and throws the city into chaos! Who would have thought Leviathan would apprealize, too? Haru gets the Gaiamon chip, but can he bring back his best friend Yujin?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-09-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/g0fuGRGSslZo6jqSNguGgGut69b.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://ima